@startuml U25_virtual_patient_state
!include style.iuml
title U25 — Virtual patient (state machine, Sprint 5)

[*] --> Arrived : arrival event\n/ urgency sampled
Arrived --> Moving : first token after Start
Moving --> Moving : instant moves\n(decision, merge, split, join)
Moving --> Queued : human task, no free staff\n/ joins role queue (urgency, arrival)
Moving --> InService : human task, staff free\n/ wait = 0
Queued --> InService : staff freed, most urgent first\n/ record wait
Moving --> InService : service / ML task or timer\n(no staff needed)
InService --> Moving : task end event\n/ deadline met or missed
Moving --> Parked : at a parallel join, other branch running
Parked --> Moving : last branch arrives
Moving --> Done : End fires and no token is left\n/ length of stay
Done --> [*]
note right of Queued
  Several states at once when parallel
  branches run (one per token).
end note
@enduml
